@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Chaos: Latency
POST {{baseUrl}}/chaos/latency
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay": 700
}

### Chaos: Error spike
POST {{baseUrl}}/chaos/error-spike

### Chaos: CPU
POST {{baseUrl}}/chaos/cpu

### Chaos: Memory leak
GET {{baseUrl}}/chaos/stress-test?intensity=1

### Heal
POST {{baseUrl}}/ops/heal
